window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v26-035-4d6c999c489cd7e9.json"]={sha256:"4d6c999c489cd7e9a9d657e5d9739fe1a2d0ecb0f1fab742de9c4dbe4780a11b",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v26-case-9227f778168eae54","url":"https://docs.openmc.org/en/stable/methods/tallies.html","title":"OpenMC tally statistics","titleEn":"OpenMC tally statistics","publisher":"OpenMC development team","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v26-035","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v26-035","related":[{"id":"hpc-v26-036","referenceUrls":["https://www.nature.com/articles/324446a0","https://www.ias.edu/piet/act/comp/algorithms"],"title":"Barnes–Hut：遠場接受準則與誤差驗證","titleEn":"Barnes–Hut: far-field acceptance and error checks","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付樣本血緣、SE縮放與重複樣本反例；兩SE相符，獨立性、樣本唯一性與p來源明示；請另一位學徒依交付件重新推導一組；未通過或資料不足必須明記，不以品牌或峰值取代證據。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver sample lineage, standard-error scaling, and a duplicate-sample counterexample. Both standard errors must match, with independence, sample uniqueness, and the source of p stated. Have another learner derive one case from the handover; label failures or missing evidence without substituting brand names or peak rates.","difference":"畫目標粒子、群集邊界與質心，標s和d的定義；近距群必須展開；.2接受、.4展開，報告另有直接力參考與誤差定義。","differenceEn":"Draw the target, cluster bounds, and center of mass. Define s and d explicitly and open nearby groups. Accept 0.2 and open 0.4. Include an independent direct-force reference and explicit error definition.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["已知教學p時，樣本均值標準差SE=sqrt(p(1−p)/N)，前提是獨立同分布；合成p=.25，N10000對40000；這是模型SE，不是某次量測信賴區間；名義式 sqrt(.25*.75/10000) = 0.00433012701892 probability standard error；變更式 sqrt(.25*.75/40000) = 0.00216506350946 probability standard error。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","簡化接受量s/d，若s/d\u003cθ才以群集近似；此幾何條件不直接等於力誤差；合成群寬s2、距離d10，θ.25；變更d5，保持s與θ；名義式 2/10 = 0.2 opening ratio；變更式 2/5 = 0.4 opening ratio。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["For teaching probability p, the sample-mean standard error is sqrt(p(1−p)/N), assuming independent identically distributed trials. Synthetic p = 0.25, N = 10000 versus 40000. This model standard error is not a measured confidence interval. Nominal sqrt(.25*.75/10000) = 0.00433012701892 probability standard error; changed sqrt(.25*.75/40000) = 0.00216506350946 probability standard error. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","The simplified rule accepts a group when s/d \u003c θ. This geometric ratio is not a direct bound on force error. Synthetic group size s = 2, distance d = 10, θ = 0.25; compare d = 5 with fixed s and θ. Nominal 2/10 = 0.2 opening ratio; changed 2/5 = 0.4 opening ratio. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v26-045","referenceUrls":["https://www.spec.org/cpu2017/Docs/runrules.html"],"title":"SPEC 思維：重複量測、變異與效能宣稱","titleEn":"SPEC principles: repeated timing and performance claims","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付樣本血緣、SE縮放與重複樣本反例；兩SE相符，獨立性、樣本唯一性與p來源明示；請另一位學徒依交付件重新推導一組；未通過或資料不足必須明記，不以品牌或峰值取代證據。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver sample lineage, standard-error scaling, and a duplicate-sample counterexample. Both standard errors must match, with independence, sample uniqueness, and the source of p stated. Have another learner derive one case from the handover; label failures or missing evidence without substituting brand names or peak rates.","difference":"建立跑次、輸入hash、編譯選項、暖機、開始完成事件及其他負載欄；1.8/2正確，所有六樣本保留、基準一致且沒有冒稱正式SPEC分數。","differenceEn":"Record run identity, input hash, compiler options, warmup, start and completion events, and competing load. Verify 1.8 and 2, retain all six samples, use the same baseline, and make no official SPEC-score claim.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["已知教學p時，樣本均值標準差SE=sqrt(p(1−p)/N)，前提是獨立同分布；合成p=.25，N10000對40000；這是模型SE，不是某次量測信賴區間；名義式 sqrt(.25*.75/10000) = 0.00433012701892 probability standard error；變更式 sqrt(.25*.75/40000) = 0.00216506350946 probability standard error。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","三次量測以中位數描述典型時間；同時保留全部樣本和範圍，不只挑最快一次；合成A時間[9,10,30]秒，B[8,9,10]秒；比較各中位數相對固定基準18秒的速度；名義式 18/10 = 1.8 median-based speedup；變更式 18/9 = 2 median-based speedup。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["For teaching probability p, the sample-mean standard error is sqrt(p(1−p)/N), assuming independent identically distributed trials. Synthetic p = 0.25, N = 10000 versus 40000. This model standard error is not a measured confidence interval. Nominal sqrt(.25*.75/10000) = 0.00433012701892 probability standard error; changed sqrt(.25*.75/40000) = 0.00216506350946 probability standard error. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Use the median of three runs to describe typical time, while retaining every sample and the range. Synthetic A times [9, 10, 30] and B times [8, 9, 10] seconds. Compare median speedups against one fixed 18-second baseline. Nominal 18/10 = 1.8 median-based speedup; changed 18/9 = 2 median-based speedup. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v26-case-e5a91c495ee9672f","url":"https://www.nature.com/articles/324446a0","title":"A hierarchical O(N log N) force-calculation algorithm","titleEn":"A hierarchical O(N log N) force-calculation algorithm","publisher":"Barnes and Hut / Nature","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v26-case-e9372457371e1dd4","url":"https://www.ias.edu/piet/act/comp/algorithms","title":"Algorithms: hierarchical tree codes","titleEn":"Algorithms: hierarchical tree codes","publisher":"Piet Hut / Institute for Advanced Study","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v26-case-29bc9b74199f0f85","url":"https://www.spec.org/cpu2017/Docs/runrules.html","title":"SPEC CPU run and reporting rules","titleEn":"SPEC CPU run and reporting rules","publisher":"SPEC","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
